<p id="mwDA"><i id="mwDQ"><b id="mwDg">Closer to the Sun</b></i> is the fourth studio album by the rock band <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slightly_Stoopid" title="Slightly Stoopid" id="mwDw">Slightly Stoopid</a>, released in 2005. It debuted at #121 on the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Billboard_200" title="Billboard 200" id="mwEA">Billboard 200</a> chart.<sup about="#mwt12" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-2"}}'><a href="#cite_note-2" id="mwEQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwEg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEw">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

